  "keyFeatures": [
    "Onchain data API covering 60+ EVM chains with a single API key",
    "Account endpoints: balances, transactions, token transfers (ERC-20/721/1155), internal transactions",
    "Contract endpoints: ABI retrieval, source code, verification (Solidity, Vyper, Stylus, zkSync, Proxy)",
    "Gas Tracker: oracle, estimation, daily statistics",
    "Token endpoints: supply, balances, holder lists, NFT inventory",
    "Event logs retrieval by address, topics, or combined filters",
    "Geth/Parity JSON-RPC proxy for standard eth_ calls",
    "Etherscan Metadata: nametags, labels, reputation scores for addresses",
    "Build with AI: MCP server, CLI tool, installable agent skills",
    "L2 deposit/withdrawal transaction support",
    "Stats endpoints: network stats, daily metrics, price history",
    "Beta: Prediction market data APIs"
  ],
